      "updated": 1772168882788,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "list1\n\nhead(list1) = 22\ntail(list1) = 66\n\nTo access second last node I dont have any formula or shortcut\nI have to traverse through every node\n\nFor this reason (To get any node from both sides is the optimal way)\n\nThis is how we can achieve without traversing whole linked List",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "list1\n\nhead(list1) = 22\ntail(list1) = 66\n\nTo access second last node I dont have any formula or shortcut\nI have to traverse through every node\n\nFor this reason (To get any node from both sides is the optimal way)\n\nThis is how we can achieve without traversing whole linked List",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
