      "text": "int count = 0;\nwhile(count <= 2){\ntemp = temp.next;\ncount++;\nif(count ==2){\nbreak;\n}\n}\nnode.next = temp.next;\ntemp.next.prev = node;\ntemp.next = node;\nnode.prev = temp;",
